but note need to address cooperation.\n\nGiven the criteria, crew cooperation is critical. Unfriendly may be more severe than pretentious? Both are concerns. But C's leadership may mitigate unfriendly? Not sure. I think we can argue that Candidate B's stress resilience and conscientiousness are more directly safety-critical, and his communication issues are less severe than C's unfriendly demeanor. So we could shift vote to B.\n\nThus our vote: Candidate B.\n\nWe need to reference Agent 1's recommendation and our own facts: B handles stress well, very conscientious; concerns: pretentious, wrong tone. C's unfriendly. So we argue that B is better overall.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON."}
